WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.860
Hey, if you're going through a difficult time&nbsp;
- trials and tribulations - they will come.&nbsp;

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.440
You need to understand that and know that.&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:11.280
God is not always just going to take you out&nbsp;
of it because He wants to teach you endurance.&nbsp;

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.240
So that you will be able to overcome&nbsp;
the challenges that are in front of you.&nbsp;

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.360
Not just to sort out the&nbsp;
situation you're in right now.&nbsp;

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:24.840
I'm going to read a quote for you from my book&nbsp;
called Bold Pursuit that I want you to listen to.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:32.940
Through trials we learn that we can never&nbsp;
find true joy and peace from temporary things.&nbsp;

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:39.300
Joy and peace come only from God&nbsp;
even in the middle of a storm.&nbsp;

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.220
Jesus said: "I said these things&nbsp;
to you that your joy may be full."&nbsp;

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.420
Your joy doesn't come from things -&nbsp;
from people - from this temporary world.&nbsp;

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.300
It cannot.
If it does, there's a problem&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:55.680
with your relationship with God.
In Him is everything you need.&nbsp;

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.560
I love you guys and I'll&nbsp;
see you in the next video.&nbsp;

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.220
Bye.

